# Third-party SOURCE packs stay local: this repository is public and the raw Mixamo FBX pack,
# Sketchfab GLBs and the .blend files that embed them must not be redistributed standalone.
# The game's runtime assets (public/assets/**) are committed — they are what the game ships.
# See docs/ASSET_PIPELINE.md and docs/CONTEXT.md §4 for where each source file must be placed.
assets/characters/
assets/materials/
assets/vegetation/
assets/blender/

